PURPOSE AND EVIDENCE STATUS

Investigate input-only pretraining for MLPF without changing its transformer or
HEPTv2 backbone. The initial implementation used CLD tracks/clusters; the current
investigation uses raw tracker and calorimeter hits. Supervised particle targets
are used only for downstream probes, not the distillation loss.

This log consolidates the findings reported in the working session. The current
large-run artifacts were checked directly while writing this log. The earlier
experiments/cld_ssl_fast and experiments/cld_hits_ssl directories are no longer
present in this workspace. Results from those runs below are historical records
from the preceding analyses, not newly reverified measurements. Their historical
paths are retained for identification, not as claims of current availability.

